// Keep this directory present in git so the C++ smoke harness can
// expect a stable runtime path for `sparse_smoke_n16.bin`. The bin
// itself is .gitignored — it is regenerated by
// `cargo run -p gf2-coding --example sparse_smoke_emit_expected
//  --features bench-csv -- --output benchmarks/expected/sparse_smoke_n16.bin`
// every smoke run (see `benchmarks/smoke.sh`).
